# What may go INTO the Docker image. Everything is left out (*), then only what Prism needs to run
# is let back in (!). So secrets (.env), real questions (logs/, intake/), data and the big Laya
# models can never slip in by accident.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!src/
!configs/
!models/
!finetuned/bge_ft_v2/
!recordings/

# Even inside those folders: no Python caches
**/__pycache__
